      "steps_unavailable": "Two-slot correlative frame: Noun1 + から + Noun2 + にかけて (朝から夜にかけて, 北から南にかけて). The op enum transforms one base and appends fixed literal tokens, so no ordered sequence can supply the second, freely chosen noun; it would emit 朝から or 夜にかけて alone, and neither half is this pattern."
