      "steps_unavailable": "Pre-predicate adverb plus an obligatory negative predicate: 決して opens the sentence and applies no operation to the verb, which simply ends in the ordinary negative (決して遅刻しない, 決して〜ないでください). The closed op enum has no prepend operation, and steps covering only the negative half would emit 書かない — plain negation, not this emphatic frame — so the whole identity of the point sits in the slot the steps cannot fill."
